# Sergei ML2 (Sechzig ML2 module): ECP5 LFE5U-45F in CABGA256.
#
#   zfpga build /fpga/examples/blink.v -b sergei_ml2
#
# The pins are the tree's own boards/sergei_ml2.lpf, installed beside this
# file as sergei2.lpf (the card's 8.3 names; build.c maps sergei_ml2 to it).
# zfpga places only what a design uses, so the DDR3 constraints in
# that file are harmless to a blink or a jumploader. `pack -c`:
# compressed, as Zeitlos's own build is.
device  LFE5U-45F
package CABGA256
lpf     sergei2.lpf
pack    -c
